#: scenario9:scenario9_46706B49_29D8_4537_B65A_0914A867078C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da6e767c2cc881a0b52b8394780f8801fb653c7412f444dd246e5a41906816c2
#. default-sha256: 26ffe553cbab4eacd672b81ad584cb7d9afe2d7427db52ef578c2eb147e3c36e
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_46706B49_29D8_4537_B65A_0914A867078C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your uncovering of the truth of those events that transpired so many years ago allowed me to "
"remember everything I had forgotten."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫당신이 과거를 밝혀내신 덕분에 ⟪k:2⟫저도 제가 누구인지 떠올랐어요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_530F73F2_8854_456F_9C0E_38F07572BA08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 453f5c98d503cc61b696e7f924f1f36395b206b3155294795cd3bc185468123f
