msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_530F73F2_8854_456F_9C0E_38F07572BA08"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To remember who I am."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모든 걸…… 마침내 떠올렸어요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_BC25A711_5E45_4DC4_8C15_3BF938940FA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa8154b1cdcbdb6f20090eadee16714a22d3eb043542079247ab7aa6790c940b
#. default-sha256: d53e2856923c50efe116f3c9ce8ad724a915575164ca16cfb0488951acf6cdb6
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_BC25A711_5E45_4DC4_8C15_3BF938940FA9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You mean that you’re a part of Morgana?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모르가나의…… ⟪k:1⟫일부란 사실을……?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6E4A8859_8DE0_46C7_ADD1_3C484B066284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb1358bd321e5d261f4a17a03f7666d56e618855f6da4464bb9e40094593f294
#. default-sha256: 95914fdf038e7d4ab0359bfa61583feeb9da8bb74ac1650fe8590d4ad55e65a7
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6E4A8859_8DE0_46C7_ADD1_3C484B066284"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My apologies. Bringing your soul here without any preparation has left you in a bit of a... "
"⟪k:1⟫nebulous state."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫죄송해요……, ⟪k:1⟫급하게 ⟪k:2⟫당신의 혼을 제게로 불러와서―― ⟪k:3⟫당신의 존재를 불확실하게 만들"
"었어요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_848F96ED_BA6F_4955_9574_ACD71035010C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8289a70bbf9e3c4ce58c52811cc9bc0669b32d4a3eb046b130c48f482269d24
#. default-sha256: e126699561523ad90853a56ca78581d014f8c3d6f334f7097176fe02fe1a82c4
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_848F96ED_BA6F_4955_9574_ACD71035010C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though you have no voice, I can feel your presence quite clearly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지금…… ⟪k:1⟫당신의 목소리는 못 듣지만…… ⟪k:2⟫그 존재는 뚜렷하게 느껴져요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_F99BC3F3_7E85_4E9C_A5B6_4FD65CB2734C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9fca4defa54bdb500677ea1d8712409abc64f021ffc7cf865377f3bcb14724a
#. default-sha256: b34dbb06f39552f76a6f15f15649a597f3f92922deb7783527e6b9b9585089bc
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_F99BC3F3_7E85_4E9C_A5B6_4FD65CB2734C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫O Michel, namesake of the great archangel Michael and man of tremendous virtue,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸……, ⟪k:1⟫천사의 이름을 지닌 긍지로운 분……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_8D172889_250D_45C2_B1D8_4CF77A59EA23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 063d2e44223181760a8c3f7c3d6c97ee3bd48aa724be70aae6985f7d36a83d39
