msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_8D172889_250D_45C2_B1D8_4CF77A59EA23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I pray you will be able to help me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫부디…… ⟪k:1⟫들어 주세요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_67E6FE66_E9AF_49A2_BAB8_937EC9E55832
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8dd58d5560e9b11220b12a475eb749cd5623f6c3ba4e73310669a58b5757fc4
#. default-sha256: 5f1764ef500f403ede597dc37857ee33222836785ccf59e1911dccde676b44cd
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_67E6FE66_E9AF_49A2_BAB8_937EC9E55832"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the flaxen-haired girl would have been able to let go of her "
"yearning for her brother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 없었다면…… ⟪k:1⟫아마빛 머리칼 소녀는 ⟪k:2⟫오빠에게 품은 연모를 포기했을 거예요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_027B724C_BA77_45BF_A9B3_771705FE3179
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6696090c3567f70e05f2fcf063d5f98b29d403f383c0cfcabe0dc2e2442aab0
#. default-sha256: 4a19e0a4b878058ffa9881ce12faf6c679bf84eabc72d97cc99b4278141d8a22
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_027B724C_BA77_45BF_A9B3_771705FE3179"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the shipwrecked merchant’s lover would not have lost her place as "
"his tether."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 없었다면…… ⟪k:1⟫해변 도시의 여성은 ⟪k:2⟫남자의 첫 사슬로 살 수 있었을 거예요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_67FA079F_C169_4B07_9CED_0EC33DBAB5BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72c7f81268fc28d878ac21e1244e240aaeb9a5c15f5ab4b19ceea820c7f0b1f0
#. default-sha256: 72e4d86dec8b46f185e328bad68cb5e9f9acd48c8a4bccc17f606c5982c3ad0a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_67FA079F_C169_4B07_9CED_0EC33DBAB5BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t been there, the ambitious businessman would not have been betrayed by his close "
"friend."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 없었다면…… ⟪k:1⟫과거에 영주였던 남성은 ⟪k:2⟫친구에게 배신당하지 않았을 거예요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_D04265D7_EB6F_45D2_AEEF_A130826FF259
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40de00495e169aeaa3da5f007fd6c7886fe46babee8f96678105302bc7f0995b
#. default-sha256: 4e21c4fd1872ffeaf8ba50f0f8cacb4864fda2a360149e5f8bc9cd7396699cab
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D04265D7_EB6F_45D2_AEEF_A130826FF259"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You always acted... ⟪k:1⟫out of the good of your heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫오히려…… ⟪k:1⟫선의로만 행동했지……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_3553894F_EA73_4C5E_BD18_85D9258CD87B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca99c8f3432278e09b0345af32b8d7abd3440e2760377edb2b00d6fee9e1e899
#. default-sha256: 7f2091f0b67c8681cb7ad4b5c7255402350761ef55a352fc7a352727aa7be810
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3553894F_EA73_4C5E_BD18_85D9258CD87B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And you’re trying to tell me that makes you culpable?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 네가…… ⟪k:1⟫가해자란 말을…… ⟪k:2⟫네 입으로 하기야……?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_53DD53DC_BE1F_481A_B933_EBB17AB7A0C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26b1a66ab762124f98a3cf451faa9cebdc9d25acefe227cbbad7f1879eca1393
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
