msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario9:scenario9_5DDACF64_5CAE_4C0A_AF83_AE2A26CEAE02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f9c2db0615f0aab2ccc3305c69ec14d336257350227b419578445a2d12b44af
#. default-sha256: 1950ed4650a188fa037b2c01cb8ab0ecef44ecd6dbad60a17b1339209b151616
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_5DDACF64_5CAE_4C0A_AF83_AE2A26CEAE02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But there’s more to the story than that, Michel."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫미셸……. ⟪k:2⟫이 해답에는 ⟪k:3⟫그 뒤가 더 있어요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_2DFF2445_2A0A_4711_97E0_093585F56C4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5da6aaec8471bd842113fe51e6c8121f8a2625c18c9a4c145a62e404a1e2bbf2
#. default-sha256: 86e8ad92b850703ef6e6f42a62970106e01d95092e9fb9991b633568f3bfbf59
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_2DFF2445_2A0A_4711_97E0_093585F56C4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her identity as a saint gave her purpose in life,⟪k:1⟫while simultaneously constraining her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 인생에 ⟪k:1⟫가장 깊게 걸린 멍에였죠."

#: scenario9:scenario9_6CB7BB40_3C95_44B3_A839_D2968D9EBE94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ad18eeb7895e742dcc47e42e91ef875dd2e157087bcb066fd33f3d203029746
#. default-sha256: 2673a3671598f829981a042983bdd672b692eeaae6b6896b66836aa96aa9ba8b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6CB7BB40_3C95_44B3_A839_D2968D9EBE94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then she severed that part of her soul."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제게 담아 ⟪k:1⟫분리시킨 거죠."

#: scenario9:scenario9_4A7D8E59_776D_418D_B0E3_A38433B512E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad12dcf0108ac149d9e2694d015d38c3ff0b30823de8dd2d34084894a83595d0
#. default-sha256: 0b1b8addbbb5f47d841fb5e461e7e0fb25a5a75646b65dd99378958c32db047e
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_4A7D8E59_776D_418D_B0E3_A38433B512E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was no longer a part of Morgana, but something entirely separate. ⟪k:1⟫However, I wasn’t "
"“me” yet, either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 순간――, ⟪k:1⟫저는 모르가나의 일부가 아닌 ⟪k:2⟫다른 존재가 되었어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫하지만 ⟪k:5⟫"
"당초에…… 저는 존재 자체가 없었어요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_9D901910_C49C_454D_8E62_7EA3B52245D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 687379eff9d3e16fedaa86f8ae79c94bbb392ade094c987d47b702668ded6c2b
#. default-sha256: 0b257867a8ad6d2ad9287aaf9da02ca9ff2b995588d944aca990023a0c498dc8
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_9D901910_C49C_454D_8E62_7EA3B52245D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But eventually, that dust gained a sense of self,⟪k:1⟫taking form as a human soul,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 그 물질 중 하나가 ⟪k:1⟫의지를 형성하여…… 사람의 혼을 갖춘 거죠."

#: scenario9:scenario9_D103C95F_E067_4B9E_A23E_5D1E2174843E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4722b54cce1554bf6913dee766ed378959925e8482bc24e722d042d36e82c07a
#. default-sha256: 5134ae3aaeffb6f7b70b11ec6b8f44ae887e3a83f3b0500b6d75c32f05584b48
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_D103C95F_E067_4B9E_A23E_5D1E2174843E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To live."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……살아가는 걸 바라요……."

#: scenario9:scenario9_A7F6DEB0_17A1_48CC_BD38_B89FF9CE350D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 499371039b3ebdf19bad2f258b3d064364b388d305bc14e45b3165b416235132
#. default-sha256: e7baaccb81b4ec54affa8ccb245ecec5c261e340de6ba2122b6ad2dba690b47b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_A7F6DEB0_17A1_48CC_BD38_B89FF9CE350D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wished for a continued existence in this world."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 저란 존재가 ⟪k:1⟫이 세계에 존속되기를 ⟪k:2⟫바랐어요."

#: scenario9:scenario9_F647F9E0_EC92_4137_8F87_3071135A8F6C
